⍝   |B̃₂ₖ₊₂(x) − B₂ₖ₊₂| ≤ 2|B₂ₖ₊₂|).  As |B₂ᵢ|/(2i)! ≤ 3.3/(2π)²ⁱ the terms fall until 2i ≈ 2πN, the smallest being about
